  "title": "Skill Valuation and Agent Behavior: Insights from AI Frameworks",
  "summary": "SkillSV introduces a structure-aware Shapley-style framework for skill valuation, while SkillClone explores behavioral skill reconstruction in black-box environments. Both frameworks address the challenges of managing evolving agent skills and ensuring functional security.",
