      "statement": "SkillClone uses legitimate interactions to reconstruct hidden skill functionality, achieving partial recovery on held-out inputs.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "SkillSV and SkillClone demonstrate the importance of structured skill valuation and black-box attack techniques in secure AI deployment.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
